1
00:00:00,214 --> 00:00:02,544
(Sheldon:)and I assumed
my career would continue

2
00:00:02,550 --> 00:00:04,620
(Sheldon:)on that upward trajectory.

3
00:00:04,619 --> 00:00:07,449
(Sheldon:)Now here I am in my 30s,

4
00:00:07,455 --> 00:00:10,455
(Sheldon:)I'm back at square one.

5
00:00:10,458 --> 00:00:13,858
(Sheldon:)And, frankly, it's frightening.

6
00:00:15,129 --> 00:00:18,469
(Raj:)Sheldon, you know
what I think of when I'm scared?

7
00:00:18,466 --> 00:00:19,836
Voyager.

8
00:00:19,834 --> 00:00:22,234
Voyager the space probe

9
00:00:22,236 --> 00:00:25,776
or Voyager
the Star Trek TV show?

10
00:00:25,773 --> 00:00:27,343
(Sheldon:)The space probe.

11
00:00:27,342 --> 00:00:29,012
(Penny:)Good.
Because I am too hot and tired

12
00:00:29,010 --> 00:00:32,040
(Sheldon:)to go on about how much
I hate Voyager the TV show.

13
00:00:33,448 --> 00:00:35,248
(Raj:)By the time
I was born,

14
00:00:35,249 --> 00:00:37,579
Voyager 1's mission
was supposed to be over.

15
00:00:37,585 --> 00:00:38,785
(Raj:)It had seen

16
00:00:38,786 --> 00:00:41,786
(Raj:)Jupiter and Saturn
and all their moons,

17
00:00:41,789 --> 00:00:44,059
(Raj:)but it kept going.

18
00:00:45,326 --> 00:00:46,996
(Raj:)When I left India for America,

19
00:00:46,995 --> 00:00:49,695
(Raj:)I was never more scared
in my life.

20
00:00:49,697 --> 00:00:52,097
(Raj:)I had no idea
what lay ahead.

21
00:00:52,100 --> 00:00:54,900
(Raj:)Whenever I feel that way,
I think about how...

22
00:00:54,902 --> 00:00:58,772
Voyager is still out there

